Z||000002||Sootah||06-12-2001||02:00 PM||||<A HREF="http://www.kazaa.com" TARGET=_blank>Kazaa</A> is pretty good. I hate the interface, but at least you can find stuff on it and its usually reasonably fast. Nothing will ever beat Napster in its glory days though.<P>------------------<BR>Never argue with an idiot, they drag you down to their level and then beat you with experience||||reg||1
Z||000003||Songman||06-12-2001||02:05 PM||||Audio Galaxy is tough to grab complete albums, and the user interface is fairly worthless as far as talking to people with similar interests. But as far as getting the most music choice, and speed... It is even better than Napster for me. I like the way it holds the titles I am looking for and grabs them automatically when they are available.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
