Z||000005||DecadenceR||06-12-2001||03:59 PM||||I just got Limewire. Good thing is that you can get movie and show clips off it too, not just music. but it is EXTREMELY slow, and poor user interface. it took me an hour to download 1 song. I have a cable modem. With a good connection to another person on napster, it took me 35 seconds!!!!!<BR>BTW - Limewire runs on the Gnotella network. So basically, it's the same results from 2 different programs.||||reg||1
